  "bio": "Step into the bold and vibrant world of Baltimore Street Tattoo, where the artistry of 'newschool' tattooing comes to life. Nestled in the heart of Westminster, this studio offers a unique and modern approach to ink, serving Hanover, PA, and surrounding areas with top-tier designs and impeccable service. Connect with them on Facebook or Twitter, or dial (717) 646-TATT to embark on your next tattoo adventure.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Westminster, Maryland, United States"
